system, key generation is randomized and this randomization is essential
for the proof of security.

\textbf{5.2 Proving Security}

We prove security of the scheme under the Decision \emph{q}-BDHI
assumption from Section 3.2.

\textbf{Theorem 5.1.} \emph{Suppose the} (\emph{t, q, ϵ})\emph{-Decision
